{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡乃木坂カフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェマネージャーのまいちゅんにオッケーもらったので、アルバイトさせてもらうことになりました！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーラとかメロンソーダとか飲み物を注いでお客さんに渡したり、まいちゅんのお手伝いをしたり、特別に作ってくれた名刺に何枚かサインして渡したりしたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと「アルバイト」って書いてあります笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイトの合間には乃木坂カフェの一つ上の階のオリジナルパンケーキハウスに行った～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダッチベイビー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アサイージュース♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ過ぎちゃいました～（´｡~ω~｡｀）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また時間があるときに予告なしにお手伝いするので是非来てくださ～い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はいつ行こっかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡じょしらくのオーディション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"波浪浮亭木胡桃（はろうきていきぐるみ）ちゃん役に選んでいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル以外の舞台は初めてだし演技もわからないことだらけだけど、今回の舞台でたくさんお勉強できたらいいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るぞ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡お花見"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族でお花見～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャボン玉したりのんびり～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡名古屋のアルバム握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 気づいたら片想い\n2部 制服のマネキン\n3部 ぐるぐるカーテン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部 夏のFree&Easy"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣の会場でSKE48さんも握手会してて、りょうはとゆづきが会いに来てくれたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りょうは♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆづき♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡京都の11th握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 個人PVのさくらんぼTシャツでツインテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくれてて握手が長引いちゃって写真撮れなかった（´｡~ω~｡｀）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰もいなかったから鏡で撮ったよ～泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部 Linettaのワンピース\n花柄のニューバランス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スニーカー履きやすくて愛用してる٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子ヘアーに花柄のゴム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の洋服とアクセサリーはお母さんが選んでくれたの(´,,・ω・,,｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違う雰囲気でメンバーからも可愛いって言ってもらえたよ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんの卒業おめでとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しくてなんでも相談できるお姉ちゃんみたいな存在です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2015/04/06/1181920/0018.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}